docs {
  # MTN Momo Pay Collections API Collection
  
  ## Overview
  Use this collection as a guide for understanding and interacting with MTN for facilitating mobile money transactions: specifically collections. 
  
  Collection is the action that describes the MCF procurring funds back from a Borrower in the case of the Kind Loans App. 
  
  ## Variables
  Ensure to use the correct variables which you can get by perusing the MTN Momo Pay Docs and registering for a developer account. As it stands, the variables used in this collection are associated with a maintainers MTN Developer account. 
  
  ## Resources
  [Collections MTN Momo Pay Resources](https://momodeveloper.mtn.com/api-details#api=collection&operation=RequesttoPay)
  
  ## Questions
  Please reach out to @Ayo on Slack if you have any questions.
}
